/* Live homepage content for the USP-banner prototype's Home page — scraped from each fascia's homepage on 06 Oct 2026
   (Playwright, iPhone 390 + desktop 1440), first ~3–4 screens below the header/USP bars.
   All seven fascias run the same CMS (Strapi blocks + blaze carousels), so a page is a list of three block types:
     tiles    — one or more images in a row (hero = one full-width tile; carousels keep the visible slides, heroes slide 1),
                with any HTML text laid over them (CTA bars, prices) as positioned overlays
     products — the product rail: title / sub / tab chips + cards
     text     — a copy block
   Each module carries an m (390) and/or d (1440) layout; a module missing one breakpoint is hidden there (as live).
   Sizes are the live px at 390 / 1440, widths are % so the page still flexes between presets. Most promo copy is baked
   into the live imagery, so it is the imagery. Images are local webp (img/home/<brand>/) so html2canvas export stays clean. */
